- ✅ Implement requests schema (removal_requests, request_events)
- ✅ Build Celery request tasks (execute_removal, web_form, email, legal_letter)
- ✅ Implement WeasyPrint PDF generation for CCPA/GDPR letters
- ✅ Create requests API router (list, filter, resubmit, status updates)
