## **Critical Success Factors**

1. **Vertical Slicing:** Each sprint delivers working end-to-end functionality
2. **Test-Driven:** Critical path tests written alongside features
3. **Dependencies:** Sprints build on each other (can't skip ahead)
4. **Parallel Work:** Within sprints, backend/frontend can work in parallel
5. **Fake Services:** Use test doubles early (fake Playwright, fake SMTP) to unblock

